{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T16:13:25.488355", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_114d5fd0-e2ae-4b6d-a65a-870da2d19c08", "task_desc": "What day of the month in November was the Wikipedia article accessed, according to the endnote located in the penultimate paragraph of page 11 in the book identified by DOI 10.2307/j.ctv9b2xdv? Provide only the numerical day.", "augmented_prompt": "## Patch history (memory)\nThese record what changed in earlier versions and why:\n- [2 @v42] [AVOID] <tool_calls:6124c78e>:  -> <tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\">\n  <参数 name=\"query\">10.2307/j.ctv9b2xdv</参数>\n</工具调用>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e> (because prior task in this benchmark)", "response": "<tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\">\n  <参数 name=\"query\">10.2307/j.ctv9b2xdv</参数>\n</工具调用>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>", "expected": "4", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 295, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "b0e4cf06", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "judgment", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "7cb32d15a57d", "prof_total_s": 48.47, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 48.47, "prof_tok_in": 347, "prof_tok_out": 181, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T16:13:26.999115", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_7dd30055-0198-452e-8c25-f73dbe27dcb8", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: Using the Biopython library in Python, parse the PDB file of the protein identified by the PDB ID 5wb7 from the RCSB Protein Data Bank. Calculate the distance between the first and second atoms as they are listed in the PDB file. Report the answer in Angstroms, rounded to the nearest picometer.", "augmented_prompt": "", "response": "```python\nimport sys, subprocess, json, os, math, textwrap, io\n\n# Ensure biopython is available\ntry:\n    import Bio\nexcept ImportError:\n    subprocess.check_call([sys.executable, \"-m\", \"pip\", \"install\", \"biopython\", \"-q\"])\n\nfrom Bio.PDB import PDBParser\nimport requests\n\npdb_id = \"5wb7\"\nurl = f\"https://files.rcsb.org/download/{pdb_id}.pdb\"\nr = requests.get(url)\nprint(\"status\", r.status_code, \"len\", len(r.text))\n# Save to file\nopen(f\"{pdb_id}.pdb\", \"w\").write(r.text)\n\nparser = PDBParser(QUIET=True)\nstructure = parser.get_structure(pdb_id, f\"{pdb_id}.pdb\")\n\natoms = list(structure.get_atoms())\nprint(\"num atoms\", len(atoms))\na1 = atoms[0]\na2 = atoms[1]\nprint(\"a1\", a1.get_parent().id, a1.id, a1.coord)\nprint(\"a2\", a2.get_parent().id, a2.id, a2.coord)\ndiff = a1.coord - a2.coord\ndist = math.sqrt((diff**2).sum())\nprint(\"dist A\", dist)\n# round to nearest picometer: 1 pm = 0.01 A\ndist_pm = round(dist * 100)  # in pm\ndist_rounded_A = dist_pm / 100.0\nprint(\"rounded A\", dist_rounded_A)\n```\n\n```python\n# Let's also directly parse the PDB file lines to confirm first two ATOM/HETATM records\nfirst_two = []\nfor line in r.text.splitlines():\n    if line.startswith(\"ATOM\") or line.startswith(\"HETATM\"):\n        first_two.append(line)\n        if len(first_two) == 2:\n            break\nprint(first_two)\ndef parse_coord(line):\n    # columns 31-38, 39-46, 47-54\n    x = float(line[30:38]); y = float(line[38:46]); z = float(line[46:54])\n    return (x,y,z)\nc1 = parse_coord(first_two[0])\nc2 = parse_coord(first_two[1])\nd = math.sqrt(sum((a-b)**2 for a,b in zip(c1,c2)))\nprint(\"direct dist\", d, \"rounded\", round(d*100)/100)\n```", "expected": "1.456", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": false, "aug_len": 0, "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.5, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "b0e4cf06", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "judgment", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "7cb32d15a57d", "prof_total_s": 48.98, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 48.98, "prof_tok_in": 294, "prof_tok_out": 1632, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
