{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T16:14:45.766110", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_8d46b8d6-b38a-47ff-ac74-cda14cf2d19b", "task_desc": "Based on the upper estimates found on English Wikipedia at the close of 2012, what fraction of the overall penguin population is represented by the penguins in this file that either do not reside on Dream Island or possess beaks exceeding 42mm in length? Provide your answer as a percentage rounded to five decimal places.", "augmented_prompt": "## Patch history (memory)\nThese record what changed in earlier versions and why:\n- [3 @v106] [AVOID] <tool_calls:6124c78e>:  -> <tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>code_execution\n<tool_call:6124c78e>code\nimport os, sys, glob\nfor root, dirs, files in os.walk('.'):\n    # skip hidden dirs maybe\n    if '/.git' in root: continue\n    for f in files:\n        print(os.path.join(root, f))\n</code>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query\nupper population estimates English Wikipedia penguin (because prior task in this benchmark)\n- [3 @v15] [AVOID] <tool_calls:6124c78e>:  -> <tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>code_execution\n<tool_call:6124c78e>code\npython\nimport os, sys, glob\nfor root, dirs, files in os.walk('.'):\n    for f in files:\n        print(os.path.join(root, f))\n</code>\n</parameter>\n</invoke>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e> (because prior task in this benchmark)", "response": "<tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>code_execution\n<tool_call:6124c78e>code\nimport os\nfor root, dirs, files in os.walk('.'):\n    # skip hidden\n    if any(part.startswith('.') for part in root.split(os.sep)):\n        continue\n    for f in files:\n        print(os.path.join(root, f))\n</code>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>", "expected": "0.00033", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "3", "p