{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T16:15:33.176650", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_17b5a6a3-bc87-42e8-b0fb-6ab0781ef2cc", "task_desc": "I'm researching invasive species that became established after pet owners released them into the wild. The fish species that gained popularity as a pet through its role as the protagonist in the film *Finding Nemo* is of particular interest. Per USGS records, in which locations was this fish documented as a nonnative species prior to 2020? Please provide your answer as the five-digit ZIP codes of those locations, separated by commas if there are multiple.", "augmented_prompt": "## Patch history (memory)\nThese record what changed in earlier versions and why:\n- [2 @v161] [AVOID] <tool_calls:6124c78e>:  -> <tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search<tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query</tool_call:6124c78e>\nfinding nemo fish usgs nonnative species zip code before 2020 Amphiprion ocellaris site:usgs.gov (because prior task in this benchmark)\n- [2 @v79] [AVOID] <tool_calls:6124c78e>:  -> <tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search<tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query</tool_call:6124c78e>\nfinding nemo fish usgs nonnative species zip code before 2020 Amphiprion ocellaris site:usgs.gov</think:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e> (because prior task in this benchmark)", "response": "<tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search<tool_sep:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query</tool_call:6124c78e>\nfinding nemo fish usgs nonnative species zip code before 2020 Amphiprion ocellaris site:usgs.gov", "expected": "34689", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 727, "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "b0e4cf06", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c