{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T16:15:37.094741", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_11af4e1a-5f45-467d-9aeb-46f4bb0bf034", "task_desc": "Please answer the following question with precision.\n\nQuestion: Compared to the encoder described in the \"Attention is All You Need\" paper, how many additional blocks (also referred to as layers) does the BERT base encoder possess?", "augmented_prompt": "## Patch history (memory)\nThese record what changed in earlier versions and why:\n- [1 @v156] [AVOID] <tool_calls:6124c78e>:  -> <tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query>Attention is All You Need Transformer base encoder layers N=6</parameter>\n</invoke>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query>BERT base encoder layers 12</parameter>\n</invoke>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e> (because prior task in this benchmark)\n- [1 @v63] [AVOID] <tool_calls:6124c78e>:  -> <tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query>BERT base number of encoder layers 12</parameter>\n</invoke>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e> (because prior task in this benchmark)", "response": "<tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query>Attention is All You Need Transformer base encoder layers N=6</parameter>\n</invoke>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query>BERT base encoder layers 12</parameter>\n</invoke>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>", "expected": "6", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "1", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 772, "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "b0e4cf06", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "judgment", "score_provenance": "self_a