nt", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "7cb32d15a57d", "prof_total_s": 68.61, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 68.61, "prof_tok_in": 407, "prof_tok_out": 393, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T16:15:59.327614", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_65da0822-a48a-4a68-bbad-8ed1b835a834", "task_desc": "Among all individuals who officially served as United States Secretary of Homeland Security before April 2019 — counting only those who were confirmed to the position, not anyone who served in an acting role — each one holds a bachelor's degree. Considering the universities that awarded these bachelor's degrees, identify the westernmost institution and the easternmost institution. Provide your answer as a comma-separated list containing only the names of the cities where these two universities a", "augmented_prompt": "## Patch history (memory)\nThese record what changed in earlier versions and why:\n- [2 @v150] [AVOID] <tool_calls:6124c78e>:  -> <tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query<tool_call:6124c78e>text>Kirstjen Nielsen bachelor's degree university</text>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query<tool_call:6124c78e>text>John F Kelly Secretary Homeland Security bachelor's degree university</text>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call: (because prior task in this benchmark)\n- [2 @v38] [AVOID] <tool_calls:6124c78e>:  -> <tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query<tool_call:6124c78e>text>Tom Ridge bachelor's degree university</text>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e> (because prior task in this benchmark)", "response": "<tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query<tool_call:6124c78e>text>United States Secretaries of Homeland Security confirmed list Tom Ridge Chertoff Napolitano Jeh Johnson Kelly Nielsen</text>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query<tool_call:6124c78e>text>Tom Ridge bachelor's degree Harvard University</text>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n<tool_call: