{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T16:17:03.080131", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_7b5377b0-3f38-4103-8ad2-90fe89864c04", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: Find the value of x to the nearest tenth: Lx = (d/dx * (A * x-squared)) + 4-thousand'n'ninety-7 minus C\nWhere L is the last two digits of the year of the Venezuelan Declaration of Independence,\nA is the number of colors in the TikTok logo as of July 2023, excluding black and white,\nand C is the height of the average woman in the Philippines according to a July 2023 Business Insider article, rounded to the nearest whole centimeter", "augmented_prompt": "", "response": "<tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query⟩\nVenezuelan Declaration of Independence year</think:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query⟩\nTikTok logo colors excluding black and white July 2023 number of colors</arg_value:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query⟩\nBusiness Insider July 2023 average woman height Philippines centimeters", "expected": "563.9", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": false, "aug_len": 0, "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "b0e4cf06", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "judgment", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "7cb32d15a57d", "prof_total_s": 346.63, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 346.63, "prof_tok_in": 332, "prof_tok_out": 568, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T16:17:12.949215", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_2b3ef98c-cc05-450b-a719-711aee40ac65", "task_desc": "I need to complete this assignment that our professor dropped on us right at the end of Friday's lecture, and I'm still working through it. The question involves an anagram. I've included an audio recording of the question the professor posed — could you listen to it and provide the answer? Please respond with only the anagram text that can be formed from the original line and satisfies the professor's requirements, with no additional commentary and no punctuation.", "augmented_prompt": "## Patch history (memory)\nThese record what changed in earlier versions and why:\n- [2 @v273] [AVOID] I'll search for this specific question to see if it's from a known source or if there's a transcript available.</think:6:  -> I'll search for this specific question to see if it's from a known source or if there's a transcript available.</think:6124c78e><tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query⟩\nprofessor sprung it on us at the end of class Friday anagram audio recording assignment\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e> (because prior task in this benchmark)\n- [2 @v280] [AVOID] <tool_calls:6124c78e>:  -> <tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query⟩\nprofessor sprung it on us at the end of class Friday anagram audio recording assignment\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e> (because prior task in this benchmark)", "response": "<tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\">\n<parameter name=\"query\">professor end of Friday lecture anagram assignment audio recording</parameter>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\">\n<parameter name=\"query\">\"dropped on us\" \"end of Friday\" anagram</parameter>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>", "expected": "To be or not to be that is the question whether tis nobler in the mind to suffer the slings and arrows of outrageous fortune", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 905, "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "b0e4cf06", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "judgment", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "7cb32d15a57d", "prof_total_s": 7.79, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 7.79, "prof_tok_in": 485, "prof_tok_out": 532, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T16:17:34.822299", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_7b5377b0-3f38-4103-8ad2-90fe89864c04", "task_desc": "Here's the reworded task:\n\n---\n\n**Question:** Solve for x, rounding your answer to the nearest tenth:\n\nLx = (d/dx × (A × x²)) + 4,097 − C\n\nwhere:\n\n- L = the final two digits of the year in which Venezuela declared independence,\n- A = the count of colors found in the TikTok logo as of July 2023, not counting black or white,\n- C = the mean height of a woman in the Philippines, in centimeters rounded to the nearest whole number, as reported in a Business Insider article from July 2023.\n\n---", "augmented_prompt": "## Patch history (memory)\nThese record what changed in earlier versions and why:\n- [2 @v286] [AVOID] <tool_calls:6124c78e>:  -> <tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query⟩\nVenezuelan Declaration of Independence year</think:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query⟩\nTikTok logo colors excluding black and white July 2023 number of colors</arg_value:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query⟩\nBusiness Insider July 2023 average woman height Ph (because prior task in this benchmark)", "response": "<tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query⟩\nVenezuela declared independence year July 5 1811 final two digits", "expected": "563.9", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 567, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "b0e4cf06", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "judgment", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "7cb32d15a57d", "prof_total_s": 6.89, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "