{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T16:51:15.559000", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_67e8878b-5cef-4375-804e-e6291fdbe78a", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: The attached PDF lists accommodations in the resort community of Seahorse Island. Which type of accommodation has a higher average rating in Seahorse Island?", "augmented_prompt": "", "response": "I'll help you analyze the accommodations in Seahorse Island. Let me first look for the PDF document you mentioned.\n\nTool call list:\n1. Tool: `search_web`\n   - `query` = `Seahorse Island accommodations PDF resort community`\n\n1. Tool: `execute_code`\n   - `code` = `import os\nimport glob\n\n# Look for PDF files in common locations\npdf_files = glob.glob('**/*.pdf', recursive=True)\nprint(\"PDF files found:\")\nfor f in pdf_files:\n    print(f)`\n\n1. Tool: `list_files`\n\n1. Tool: `read_file`\n   - `path` = `Seahorse_Island.pdf`\n\n1. Tool: `read_file`\n   - `path` = `accommodations.pdf`\n\n1. Tool: `read_file`\n   - `path` = `seahorse_island_accommodations.pdf`", "expected": "Hotels", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": false, "aug_len": 0, "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "b0e4cf06", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "judgment", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "7cb32d15a57d", "prof_total_s": 716.38, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 716.38, "prof_tok_in": 254, "prof_tok_out": 471, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
