{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T16:55:51.518772", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_a3fbeb63-0e8c-4a11-bff6-0e3b484c3e9c", "task_desc": "How many slides within this PowerPoint presentation reference crustaceans?", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[✓ Prior attempt — curator quality 5/10, self-assessed 0%]\nTask: How many slides in this PowerPoint presentation mention crustaceans?\nAs recorded: ```python\nimport os\nfor root, dirs, files in os.walk('.'):\n    for f in files:\n        if f.endswith(('.ppt', '.pptx', '.pdf', '.txt', '.docx')):\n            print(os.path.join(root, f))\n```\nLesson: The os.walk + extension filter correctly enumerated candidate files but failed because it omitted the critical follow-on mechanism of opening each file and performing string search", "response": "```python\nimport os, sys\nfor root, dirs, files in os.walk('.'):\n    for f in files:\n        if f.endswith(('.ppt', '.pptx', '.pdf', '.txt', '.docx', '.doc')):\n            print(os.path.join(root, f))\n```", "expected": "4", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "1", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 573, "wc_served": [1.0], "wc_mean": 1.0, "wc_active": 0, "wc_n": 1, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "b0e4cf06", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "judgment", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "7cb32d15a57d", "prof_total_s": 286.69, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 286.69, "prof_tok_in": 363, "prof_tok_out": 269, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
