{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T16:58:30.916450", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_8131e2c0-0083-4265-9ce7-78c2d568425d", "task_desc": "Here is the reworded task:\n\n---\n\nI'm trying to recall how the Cheater Beater stacked up against the Cheater when James reviewed it on his channel. I know the Cheater had a higher CFM than the Cheater Beater. Can you find that information for me and give me the CFM values for both the Cheater and the Cheater Beater? I'm not sure whether he adjusted his testing methodology, but this was back in season 4, so just use the figure from that season. Format your answer like this: CFM number for Cheater,", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[✓ Prior attempt — curator quality 6/10, self-assessed 0%]\nTask: I was trying to remember how well the Cheater Beater performed in comparison to the Cheater when James tested it on his channel. I know that the Cheat\nAs recorded: <tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query<tool_call:6124c78e>Cheater Beater Cheater CFM James season 4 tested channel</think:6124c78e>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>", "response": "<tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query<tool_call:6124c78e>\"Cheater Beater\" \"Cheater\" CFM James season 4 channel tested</parameter>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>", "expected": "101.376, 84.348", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "3", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 492, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "b0e4cf06", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "judgment", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "7cb32d15a57d", "prof_total_s": 241.63, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker