{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T16:58:30.917177", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_42576abe-0deb-4869-8c63-225c2d75a95a", "task_desc": "In the constructed language Tizin, basic sentence structure follows Verb → Direct Object → Subject order. You want to tell your Tizin-speaking friend that you enjoy apples.\n\nThe first-person pronoun takes these forms: \"Pa\" (nominative), \"Mato\" (accusative), and \"Sing\" (genitive).\n\nThe verb root for strong liking is \"Maktay.\" In the present tense it stays in root form; for the preterit past it becomes \"Tay\"; for the imperfect past it becomes \"Aktay.\" Crucially, its usage differs from English — it", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[✓ Prior attempt — curator quality 5/10, self-assessed 50%]\nTask: In the fictional language of Tizin, basic sentences are arranged with the Verb first, followed by the direct object, followed by the subject of the se\nAs recorded: Maktay Mato Apple", "response": "Maktay Mato Apple", "expected": "Maktay mato apple", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "1", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 294, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 1.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "b0e4cf06", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "judgment", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "7cb32d15a57d", "prof_total_s": 347.77, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 347.77, "prof_tok_in": 487, "prof_tok_out": 2694, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T16:58:30.917403", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_65da0822-a48a-4a68-bbad-8ed1b835a834", "task_desc": "Please answer the following question precisely.\n\nQuestion: Every person who officially served as United States Secretary of Homeland Security before April 2019 — not counting anyone who served only in an acting role — earned a bachelor's degree. Among the universities that awarded these bachelor's degrees, identify the one situated farthest west and the one situated farthest east. Provide your answer as a comma-separated list containing only the names of the cities where those universities are l", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[✓ Prior attempt — curator quality 5/10, self-assessed 50%]\nTask: All of the individuals who formally held the position of United States secretary of homeland security prior to April 2019, excluding those who held th\nAs recorded: <tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query_t__>Tom Ridge bachelor's degree university location</parameter>\n</invoke>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>", "response": "<tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query_t__>list of United States Secretaries of Homeland Security confirmed served before April 2019</parameter>\n</invoke>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query_t__>Tom Ridge bachelor's degree Harvard University Cambridge</parameter>\n</invoke>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query_t__>Michael Chertoff bachelor's degree Harvard College</parameter>\n</invoke>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query_t__>Janet Napolitano bachelor's degree Santa Clara University</parameter>\n</invoke>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query_t__>Jeh Johnson bachelor's degree Morehouse College Atlanta</parameter>\n</invoke>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query_t__>John Kelly bachelor's degree University of Massachusetts Amherst</parameter>\n</invoke>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query_t__>Kirstjen Nielsen bachelor's degree Georgetown University Washington DC</parameter>\n</invoke>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>", "expected": "Santa Clara, Boston", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 474, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "b0e4cf06", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "judgment", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "7cb32d15a57d", "prof_total_s": 238.78, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 238.78, "prof_tok_in": 406, "prof_tok_out": 1761, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T16:58:30.917499", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_9e1fc53b-46ff-49a1-9d05-9e6faac34cc5", "task_desc": "A newly released dungeon in World of Warcraft is being tackled by a 5-player party consisting of one tank, one healer, and three DPS. Among them, two wear plate armor and two wear cloth armor. At the final boss encounter, both the tank and the healer are casting holy spells. Two different DPS are using ice and fire, respectively. A bear from the group is attacking the boss. The spell Metamorphosis is cast. The Kilt of the Forgotten One drops as loot, but nobody in the party can equip it. Given t", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[✓ Prior attempt — curator quality 5/10, self-assessed 50%]\nTask: A 5-man group made up of one tank, one healer, and three DPS is doing a dungeon that was just released in World of Warcraft. Two are plate wearers and\nAs recorded: <tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search_1\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>", "response": "<tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search_1\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>", "expected": "Death Knight, Hunter, Paladin, Priest, Warlock", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "3", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 376, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 0.5, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "b0e4cf06", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "judgment", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "7cb32d15a57d", "prof_total_s": 241.14, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 241.14, "prof_tok_in": 457, "prof_tok_out": 4773, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
