{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T17:01:59.383498", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_50ad0280-0819-4bd9-b275-5de32d3b5bcb", "task_desc": "Rewrite the following task using different wording while preserving every detail, number, entity, constraint, and the expected answer exactly.\n\nQuestion: Extract the sentence hidden within the 5×7 grid of text below. Proceed left to right and use every letter in sequence:\n\nTHESE\nAGULL\nGLIDE\nDPEAC\nEFULL\nYTOMY\nCHAIR", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[✓ Prior attempt — curator quality 5/10, self-assessed 50%]\nTask: Pull out the sentence in the following 5x7 block of text. Read from left to right and use all of the letters in order:\n\nTHESE\nAGULL\nGLIDE\nDPEAC\nEFULL\n\nAs recorded: THE SEAGULL GLIDED PEACEFULLY TO MY CHAIR", "response": "Decode the concealed sentence within the 5×7 letter grid shown below. Traverse the grid left to right, row by row, and concatenate every letter exactly in the sequence given:\n\nTHESE\nAGULL\nGLIDE\nDPEAC\nEFULL\nYTOMY\nCHAIR\n\nReason through the process step by step, use tools if necessary, and write the final answer on the last line.", "expected": "The seagull glided peacefully to my chair.", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "1", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 318, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "b0e4cf06", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "judgment", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "7cb32d15a57d", "prof_total_s": 355.8, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 355.8, "prof_tok_in": 392, "prof_tok_out": 7585, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
