{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T17:01:59.385045", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_2b3ef98c-cc05-450b-a719-711aee40ac65", "task_desc": "Could you assist me with this assignment? Our professor surprised us with it at the end of Friday's class, and I'm still working through it. The question he posed was about an anagram. I've included an audio recording of the question he asked, so if you could listen to it and provide the answer, I'd be very grateful. Please restrict your response to just the anagram text that can be formed from the original line and satisfies the professor's request, with no additional commentary. Also, please o", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[✓ Prior attempt — curator quality 5/10, self-assessed 50%]\nTask: Could you help me out with this assignment? Our professor sprung it on us at the end of class Friday, and I'm still trying to figure it out. The quest\nAs recorded: I need to search for context about this specific assignment or audio recording, as no audio file is directly provided in the text. Let me search the web.</think:6124c78e><tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query⟩\"professor sprung it on us at the end of class Friday\" anagram</parameter>\n</invoke>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>", "response": "<tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query⟩\"professor sprung it on us at the end of class Friday\"</parameter>\n</invoke>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>", "expected": "To be or not to be that is the question whether tis nobler in the mind to suffer the slings and arrows of outrageous fortune", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 655, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "b0e4c