{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T17:06:16.846655", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_676e5e31-a554-4acc-9286-b60d90a92d26", "task_desc": "Reword the following task, keeping all facts, numbers, entities, constraints, and the expected answer identical—only alter the wording and sentence structure:\n\n---\n\nDetermine the answer to the question below with precision.\n\nQuestion: Starting from July 2, 1959, the United States issued standards for grades of processed fruits, vegetables, and certain other products categorized as dehydrated. Within the \"dried and dehydrated section,\" include only those items explicitly labeled as dehydrated. Al", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[✓ Prior attempt — curator quality 5/10, self-assessed 50%]\nTask: In July 2, 1959 United States standards for grades of processed fruits, vegetables, and certain other products listed as dehydrated, consider the item\nAs recorded: <tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\t\n  - query\t: \"United States standards for grades of processed fruits, vegetables, and certain other products\" \"July 2, 1959\"\t\n  - count\t: 10\t\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>", "response": "Find the exact answer to the question that follows.\n\nQuestion: Using the United States grade standards for processed fruits, vegetables, and certain other products classified as dehydrated that were issued starting July 2, 1959 as a basis, take from the “dried and dehydrated section” solely the items explicitly identified as dehydrated, and likewise take from the Frozen/Chilled section any items shown by their complete names, excluding those identified as Chilled. As of August 2023, what portion (rounded to the nearest whole percentage) of those standards has been replaced by a more recent version dated after the date given in the 1959 standards?", "expected": "86", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "3", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 516, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 1.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "b0e4cf06", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "judgment", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "7cb32d15a57d", "prof_total_s": 339.34, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 339.34, "prof_tok_in": 490, "prof_tok_out": 2404, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T17:06:16.846837", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_384d0dd8-e8a4-4cfe-963c-d37f256e7662", "task_desc": "Here is the reworded task:\n\n---\n\nFrom the NCATS PubChem compound database, within the Food Additive Status classification, locate the compound satisfying all of the following criteria: molecular weight ≤ 100 g/mol, exactly 6 heavy atoms, at most 1 hydrogen bond acceptor, and complexity in the range of 10 to 15. This compound has two possible enzyme transformations. Considering the gene-chemical co-occurrences that these two transformations share, determine the PubChem CID of the co-occurrence wi", "augmented_prompt": "## What to avoid (from earlier attempts)\n\n[✗ Earlier attempt fell short]\nTask: In the NCATS PubChem compound database for Food Additive Status classification, find the compound that has a molecular weight of 100 g/mol or less, 6 \nAs recorded (self-assessed doubtful, verify before reuse): <tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query⟩NCATS PubChem compound database Food Additive Status classification</qu\nAvoid: Performing a general web search with descriptive queries for database classifications without directly querying PubChem's REST API endpoints for compound properties or using the 'F", "response": "<tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query⟩NCATS PubChem \"Food Additive Status\" classification compound</qu\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>", "expected": "4192", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "3", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 627, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "b0e4cf06", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "judgment", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy