{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T17:10:48.124601", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_9d191bce-651d-4746-be2d-7ef8ecadb9c2", "task_desc": "Here's the reworded task:\n\n---\n\n**Task:** Watch the YouTube video located at https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1htKBjuUWec, then determine what Teal'c replies when asked, \"Isn't that hot?\"", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[✓ Prior attempt — curator quality 5/10, self-assessed 0%]\nTask: Examine the video at https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1htKBjuUWec.\n\nWhat does Teal'c say in response to the question \"Isn't that hot?\"\nAs recorded: <tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n```\n\"1htKBjuUWec\" Teal'c \"Isn't that hot\"\n```</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>\nLesson: Web search restricted to exact video ID + character name + partial quote fails when the dialogue is not indexed in page titles/descriptions/transcripts snippets, because search eng", "response": "<tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n```\nTeal'c \"Isn't that hot\" response\n```</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>", "expected": "Extremely", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "1", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 590, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "b0e4cf06", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "judgment", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "7cb32d15a57d", "prof_total_s": 446.69, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 446.69, "prof_tok_in": 413, "prof_tok_out": 269, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T17:10:48.124791", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_8f80e01c-1296-4371-9486-bb3d68651a60", "task_desc": "Here's the reworded task:\n\n---\n\nQuestion: In bass clef, the note letters shown in the sheet music spell out a word. Take the total number of lines plus the total number of notes in the image, subtract the number of notes that sit on lines, and you'll get the age of someone who has lived through that word. What is that age?", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[✓ Prior attempt — curator quality 5/10, self-assessed 0%]\nTask: Using bass clef notes, what is the age of someone who has experienced the word spelled out in the sheet music by the note letters the total number of \nAs recorded: <tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query<tool_call:6124c78e>bass clef notes age of someone who has experienced the word spelled out in the sheet music total number of lines and notes minus the number of notes on lines in the image</query>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>", "response": "<tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query<tool_call:6124c78e>\"bass clef\" \"spell out a word\" \"sheet music\" \"age\"</query>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query<tool_call:6124c78e>\"note letters\" \"spell out\" \"bass clef\" \"word\"</query>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query<tool_call:6124c78e>\"total number of lines\" \"total number of notes\" \"bass clef\"</query>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>", "expected": "90", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 597, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "b0e4cf06", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "judgment", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "7cb32d15a57d", "prof_total_s": 332.59, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 332.59, "prof_tok_in": 411, "prof_tok_out": 514, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T17:10:48.124989", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_0e9e85b8-52b9-4de4-b402-5f635ab9631f", "task_desc": "Here is the reworded variant:\n\n---\n\nUsing the first citation reference link found on the most recent version of Carl Nebel's Wikipedia article (as of August 2023), navigate to the linked webpage. On that page, locate the image displayed there, and identify the most recent year (in chronological terms) written within that image.", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[✓ Prior attempt — curator quality 5/10, self-assessed 50%]\nTask: What is the latest chronological year date written in the image on the webpage found when following the first citation reference link on the latest ve\nAs recorded: ```python\nimport requests, json, datetime\n# Get revisions of Carl Nebel page around August 2023\napi = \"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/api.php\"\nparams = {\n    \"action\": \"query\",\n    \"format\": \"json\",\n    \"prop\": \"revisions\",\n    \"titles\": \"Carl Nebel\",\n    \"rvlimit\": \"50\",\n    \"rvdir\": \"newer\",\n    \"rvstart\": \"2023-08-01T00:00:00Z\",\n    \"rvend\": \"2023-08-31T23:59:59Z\",\n    \"rvprop\": \"ids|timestamp\"\n}\nr", "response": "```python\nimport requests, json, re\n\napi = \"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/api.php\"\n\n# Get the latest revision of Carl Nebel before 2023-09-01\nparams = {\n    \"action\": \"query\",\n    \"format\": \"json\",\n    \"prop\": \"revisions\",\n    \"titles\": \"Carl Nebel\",\n    \"rvlimit\": \"1\",\n    \"rvdir\": \"older\",\n    \"rvend\": \"2023-09-01T00:00:00Z\",\n    \"rvprop\": \"ids|timestamp|content\",\n    \"rvslots\": \"main\"\n}\nr = requests.get(api, params=params, timeout=20)\ndata = r.json()\npage = next(iter(data[\"query\"][\"pages\"].values()))\nrev = page[\"revisions\"][0]\nprint(\"Timestamp:\", rev[\"timestamp\"])\nprint(\"Rev ID:\", rev[\"revid\"])\ncontent = rev[\"slots\"][\"main\"][\"*\"]\n# show first 2000 chars\nprint(content[:2000])\n```\n\n", "expected": "1927", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 677, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "b0e4cf06", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "judgment", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "7cb32d15a57d", "prof_total_s": 671.86, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 671.86, "prof_tok_in": 488, "prof_tok_out": 848, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
