{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T17:21:16.642123", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_983bba7c-c092-455f-b6c9-7857003d48fc", "task_desc": "**Reworded Task:**\n\nPlease answer this question correctly:\n\nOf the animals appearing in both Ilias Lagkouvardos's and Olga Tapia's publications about the alvei species within the Copenhagen-named genus (excluding any bibliography/reference sections), which ones also appear in the 2021 paper that the alvei species' Wikipedia page cites regarding a multicenter, randomized, double-blind investigation?", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[✓ Prior attempt — curator quality 5/10, self-assessed 50%]\nTask: What animals that were mentioned in both Ilias Lagkouvardos's and Olga Tapia's papers on t\nAs recorded: <tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\t\n  -query\tHafnia alvei Wikipedia 2021 multicenter randomized double-blind study\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>\n\n## What to avoid (from earlier attempts)\n\n[✗ Earlier attempt fell short]\nTask: **Reworded Task (Variant 1):**\n\nPlease provide an accurate response to the following query\nAs recorded (self-assessed doubtful, verify before reuse): <tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n  -query\tHafnia alvei Wikipedia 2021 multicenter randomized double-blind study\n</tool_call:6124c7\nAvoid: Correct approach but 0 missing steps", "response": "<tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n  -query\tHafnia alvei Wikipedia 2021 multicenter randomized double-blind study\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>", "expected": "mice", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "3", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 819, "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "b0e4cf06", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c