{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T17:21:16.708834", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_a0068077-79f4-461a-adfe-75c1a4148545", "task_desc": "Based on the information from the NIH website, how many participants were actually enrolled in the clinical trial studying H. pylori in patients with acne vulgaris, conducted from January to May 2018?", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[✓ Prior attempt — curator quality 5/10, self-assessed 50%]\nTask: What was the actual enrollment count of the clinical trial on H. pylori in acne vulgaris p\nAs recorded: <tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query<tool_call:6124c78e>query>H. pylori acne vulgaris clinical trial January May 2018 enrollment NIH</query>\n<region>us</region>\n</query>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>\n\n## What to avoid (from earlier attempts)\n\n[✗ Earlier attempt fell short]\nTask: Provide the precise enrollment figure for the H. pylori clinical trial conducted in acne v\nAs recorded (self-assessed doubtful, verify before reuse): <tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query>H. pylori acne vulgaris clinical trial January May 2018 enrollment NIH<\nAvoid: Correct approach but 0 missing steps", "response": "<tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n<tool_call:6124c78e>query>H. pylori acne vulgaris clinical trial January May 2018 enrollment NIH</query>\n</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>", "expected": "90", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "1", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 898, "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "b0e4cf06", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "judgment", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protoc