{"timestamp": "2026-07-22T17:23:40.543936", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_9d191bce-651d-4746-be2d-7ef8ecadb9c2", "task_desc": "Please watch the video located at https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1htKBjuUWec and answer the question below.\n\nQuestion: When asked \"Isn't that hot?\", what is Teal'c's reply?", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[✓ Prior attempt — curator quality 5/10, self-assessed 0%]\nTask: Examine the video at https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1htKBjuUWec.\n\nWhat does Teal'c say in\nAs recorded: <tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n```\n\"1htKBjuUWec\" Teal'c \"Isn't that hot\"\n```</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>\nLesson: Web search restricted to exact video ID + character name + partial quote fails when the dialogue is not indexed in page titles/descriptions/transcripts snippets, because search eng\n\n## What to avoid (from earlier attempts)\n\n[✗ Earlier attempt fell short]\nTask: Here's the reworded task:\n\n---\n\n**Task:** Watch the YouTube video located at https://www.y\nAs recorded (self-assessed doubtful, verify before reuse): <tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n```\nTeal'c \"Isn't that hot\" response\n```</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>", "response": "<tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n```\n\"Isn't that hot\" \"Teal'c\"\n```</tool_call:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n```\n\"Isn't that hot\" \"Stargate\"\n```</tool_call:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\n```\n\"1htKBjuUWec\" \"Stargate\"\n```</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>", "expected": "Extremely", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "1", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 915, "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 0.5, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "b0e4cf06", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "